🎨 UI / UX Design System
🧊 Glassmorphic Style

Frosted glass cards:

backdrop-filter: blur(24–40px)

Soft gradients (green → teal → blue)

Rounded corners (16–20px)

Subtle grain texture

Light & dark modes (dark with neon accents)

🧭 Navbar

Floating, sticky glass navbar

Animated scroll shrink

Gradient CTA button

Logo with subtle 3D hover tilt

🧱 Cards & Panels

Reusable glass card components

Hover lift + glow

Expandable modals/drawers for details

🎥 3D & Parallax Effects

Use Spline or React Three Fiber for:

Hero section background

Agricultural storytelling elements

Parallax layers:

Background → midground → UI

Cursor-based 3D camera movement

Lazy-load and disable heavy effects on low-end devices

✨ Animations & Motion Specs

Page transitions: fade + slide

Scroll-based reveal animations

Hover:

Scale (1 → 1.03)

Glow sweep

Modals:

Scale + opacity animation

Use Framer Motion / GSAP

Timing:

Micro-interactions: 150–250ms

UI transitions: 300–500ms

Easing:

cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)

